Polar opposite prefix and agentive suffix are two of the features (in the 
deprecative sense) of the cursed E---o.  I prefer  having separate words for 
good and bad, death and murder, etc.  There are limits, of course, but it is 
never clear where they are -- and they aren't the same for everybody.  You can 
always use the lujvo and presumably be understood, though perhaps suspected of 
meiosis.





